  {
   "day": 25,
   "tag": "bond-is-young",
   "text": "With Haven grieving, Emberhold installs their own speaker at the table — but the bond is young, and they're still deciding what Haven is. The new speaker wants to talk before the tribute changes. Grief delays the verdict: send grain (1,500 kcal), send a speaker (2 days), or let the silence answer."
  },
  {
   "day": 32,
   "tag": "speaker-install",
   "text": "Seven days of silence, and the silence answered for Haven. Emberhold's new speaker reads it plainly. (Trust -6.) Emberhold installs their own speaker at the table after all — tribute rises to 7,500 kcal/week. Grief became leverage, and they knew it would."
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "tag": "speaker-install",
   "text": "With Haven grieving, Emberhold installs their own speaker at the table. Tribute rises to 11,250 kcal/week. Grief is leverage, and they know it. The link holds — it was never with one person."
  },
  {
   "day": 65,
   "tag": "speaker-install",
   "text": "With Haven grieving again, Emberhold installs their own speaker at the table — and reaches for the grief card once more. The table has heard it before: the grief card is spent. Tribute stays at 11,250 kcal/week. The link holds — it was never with one person."
  },
